  "details": "In some group setups, you might want a group of people to be able to invite to the group without being able to see or action group join requests, or cancel existing group invites\n\nCurrently, the only permission is a merged Manage Group Invites\n\n\"Allows role to create/cancel invites, as well as accept/decline/block join requests.\"\n\nIt would be beneficial to have a permission to invite to the group, then a broader \"Manage Group Invites\" permission that does the same functionality as the old permission, and requires the new one",
